url: 'https://dracor.org/doc/api'
abstract: >-
  The DraCor API is the backend of the Drama Corpora Project
  (DraCor), an infrastructure for "Programmable Corpora". It
  is an eXist-db application that serves TEI-encoded drama
  corpora, their metadata, extracted texts and character
  network metrics through a REST API, and also provides a
  Distributed Text Services (DTS) endpoint and RDF linked
  data.
keywords:
